# Hallmark (default)

Official skill: [nutlope/hallmark](https://github.com/nutlope/hallmark) v1.1. Install: `npx skills add nutlope/hallmark` ([docs](https://www.usehallmark.com/#install)).

**Read** `.cursor/skills/hallmark/SKILL.md` (fallback `.agents/skills/hallmark/SKILL.md` or `~/.cursor/skills/hallmark/SKILL.md`) when building, auditing, redesigning, or studying UI. Load `references/` only for the active verb (slop-test, structure, study, custom-theme).

## Verbs

| Invocation | Action |
|---|---|
| default | Design flow: theme + macrostructure + slop test. Fit the existing portfolio system unless the user asks for a full rebuild. |
| `hallmark audit <target>` | Punch list only. No edits. |
| `hallmark redesign <target>` | New visual structure inside existing routes/components. Confirm before deleting files. |
| `hallmark study <screenshot\|URL>` | Extract DNA. Never pixel-clone. |

Implementation safety from upstream: in-place edits; state files before changing; deletions need explicit confirmation.

On this repo, pair with Taste + Impeccable (see `design-stack-default.mdc`).
